import HegemonCrypto.SmallWoodV8Smz9SemanticBalance

/-!
A repair regression for the former semantic-to-packed completeness obstruction.
The repaired typed target requires the enabled stable asset exactly once among
its balance slots. It now rejects the same concrete burn that actual HGV8RP03
source root 1042 rejects. This closes the known example, not universal completeness.
No executable relation or production-authority bit is changed by this module.
Only KAT definitions are reused: no native-decide KAT theorem is a dependency.
-/

